(7779155, 1293904, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Evil and disgusting - I love it!  The angle and the lighting are top notch.  I hear that playing Trouble for the rent money is a bad idea.  My only nit is the black marks on the left bills, as it seems out of place with all the red blood.</td>', 'Evil and disgusting - I love it!  The angle and the lighting are top notch.  I hear that playing Trouble for the rent money is a bad idea.  My only nit is the black marks on the left bills, as it seems out of place with all the red blood.', '2025-04-05 18:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779156, 1293928, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Simple, yet super effective.  The low angle really shows the power of the punch and also allows us to see the determination on his face.  There is a bit of visual clutter in the scene that detracts a little.  Just noticed the Mickey t-shirt - great!</td>', 'Simple, yet super effective.  The low angle really shows the power of the punch and also allows us to see the determination on his face.  There is a bit of visual clutter in the scene that detracts a little.  Just noticed the Mickey t-shirt - great!', '2025-04-05 18:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779157, 1293695, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Great image here.  My favorite.  The angle and the lighting really make the game pieces pop.  Just counted the move of the car and yes - it hits Boardwalk for a huge rent payment.  It is the little things that elevate this, such as the angles of the pieces and the sloppy placement of the two decks of cards.</td>', 'Great image here.  My favorite.  The angle and the lighting really make the game pieces pop.  Just counted the move of the car and yes - it hits Boardwalk for a huge rent payment.  It is the little things that elevate this, such as the angles of the pieces and the sloppy placement of the two decks of cards.', '2025-04-05 18:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779158, 1293919, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Very cute and well done.  Simple is good.  Isolating the pieces on the game box (I assume) really sells the game without trying to show the whole board.  As a nit the tip of the M is barely visible behind the house.  Either hide it complete or have more of it showing.</td>', 'Very cute and well done.  Simple is good.  Isolating the pieces on the game box (I assume) really sells the game without trying to show the whole board.  As a nit the tip of the M is barely visible behind the house.  Either hide it complete or have more of it showing.', '2025-04-05 18:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779159, 1293925, 91496, '<td valign="top">
I really like the shot with the forest reflection in the marbles.  The browns of the wood and trees are great the white-ish background less so.  The game connection is less strong than some others as that is a strange surface to play marbles on, but as a standalone photo it is excellent.</td>', 'I really like the shot with the forest reflection in the marbles.  The browns of the wood and trees are great the white-ish background less so.  The game connection is less strong than some others as that is a strange surface to play marbles on, but as a standalone photo it is excellent.', '2025-04-05 18:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779160, 1293906, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Very cute.  I hope the grandkids helped you.  The pose is a little static, perhaps a different composition with characters interreacting or playing a game would have had more impact.</td>', 'Very cute.  I hope the grandkids helped you.  The pose is a little static, perhaps a different composition with characters interreacting or playing a game would have had more impact.', '2025-04-05 18:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779161, 1293923, 91496, '<td valign="top">
Great collection.  Nice colors and composition.  The setup is a little flat/static.  Perhaps piling them jenga like or otherwise 3-dimensional would have had more impact.  As a nit, watch your titles.  That is a lot of Space and Super Hero games and not so many dungeons in sight.  Perhaps "So Many Games, So Little Time" would have worked.</td>', 'Great collection.  Nice colors and composition.  The setup is a little flat/static.  Perhaps piling them jenga like or otherwise 3-dimensional would have had more impact.  As a nit, watch your titles.  That is a lot of Space and Super Hero games and not so many dungeons in sight.  Perhaps "So Many Games, So Little Time" would have worked.', '2025-04-05 18:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779162, 1293835, 91496, '<td valign="top">
I love the mood here with the muted colors and the misty background.  The subject is a bit lost between the large area of green and the sky.  Also I think a more action-like pose would have had more impact.</td>', 'I love the mood here with the muted colors and the misty background.  The subject is a bit lost between the large area of green and the sky.  Also I think a more action-like pose would have had more impact.', '2025-04-05 18:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7779178, 1293917, 91496, '<td valign="top">
